     – loads bytes with ld1b,
     – shifts (lsr) and masks (and) them,
     – reverses the predicate order (rev),
     – “splice”s two vectors and then extracts (ext) part of the result,
     – extracts the last active element with lastb,
     – uses cntw/cnth to count how many elements were processed, before
       advancing the pointer.
